| `src/store/ui.js` | Modify | `mutations.openChat` | Guard against a missing chat and mark the chat active (`$storex.chats.setActiveChatId`) before opening it, so opening a chat by id always navigates to *that* chat. Uses the mutation (not the `chats.setActiveChat` action) to avoid re-entrancy. |
