### Notes
- **Why `setActiveChatId` and not `setActiveChat`:** `chats.setActiveChat` *calls* `ui.openChat`; calling it back from `ui.openChat` would loop. `setActiveChatId` is a plain mutation, so it is safe.
- **Behavior preserved:** meets and user/local posts (no `chatId`) keep the existing Thread modal; only chat-sourced cards navigate.
