**Strategy**
1. Extract the SprintTaskCard unread rule into a **shared pure helper** (`src/utils/chatUnread.js`) so the task card and the wall agree — single source of truth.
2. In `wallEvents.js`, compute `unreadCount` per post (current user passed through `buildPosts`), only for chat/task kinds.
