**Dependencies / risks**
- Message `read_by` is populated by the server (`mark-seen`); wall posts from `chats.list()` may only carry the last message (same optimistic limitation documented in `SprintTaskCard`). No regression — the count is simply conservative.
- Meets/PR/notification cards are unaffected (guarded by kind).

