## 5. Notes & Follow-ups
- **API follow-up:** `loadRecentProjectChats` is the temporary 3-project read (`WALL_PROJECT_LIMIT`) guarded by `p.$api`. Once a single cross-project activity endpoint exists, replace that method with one call — the rest of the pipeline (`wallChats` → `buildPosts` newest-first → `filterPosts`) stays unchanged.
- **Accessibility:** the Unread selector uses `aria-pressed`, a `title`, and shows its count next to the label (no colour-only signal).
- **Design consistency:** the selector reuses daisyUI `btn`/`badge` tokens; the project picker reuses the existing `ProjectDetailt` (with `!w-auto` so its `w-full` trigger doesn't stretch the composer toolbar).

