I'll analyze the requested changes by exploring the relevant files before proposing modifications.Let me examine the wall timeline/post card rendering and search for any `capture` attribute usage.Let me confirm the best practice for the mobile file-picker behavior before proposing that change.I now have a complete picture of the Wall, its composer, the attachment pipeline, and the file inputs. Here is my analysis and the proposed changes.

## 1. Analysis & Pre-Thinking

**Core Requirements**
1. **Title** — the Wall header (`home` route) shows `"Activity"`; it must read **"Welcome &lt;user name&gt;"**.
2. **Unread not filtering** — the "Unread" chip toggles `unreadOnly`, but `filterPosts` in `wallEvents.js` **ignores that option** (it only accepts `tab/kind/query/following`), so the feed never narrows. `Wall.vue` already passes `unreadOnly` and `post.unreadCount` is already computed — only the filter is missing.
3. **Audio notes/messages** — record a voice note in the composer and attach it as a **base64 attachment with an `audio/*` type**, then preview/play it (composer preview + feed card).
4. **File browsing default** — the upload input must open the OS picker (albums / Downloads) instead of jumping to the camera, and it should also allow audio.

**Strategic Approach**
- `wallEvents.filterPosts`: add the `unreadOnly` option (single source of truth) and add an `audio` branch to `messageAttachment`.
- `ChatAttachment`: add `isAudio()`.
- `WallComposer`: add a mic **record/stop** button using `MediaRecorder`, store the blob as a `ChatAttachment` (base64), show a recording timer, broaden the hidden input `accept` to `image/*,audio/*` (no `capture` → opens the file/album picker, not the camera).
- `ChatAttachmentPreview`: play `audio/*` attachments in the preview modal + audio icons.
- `WallAttachment`: render audio notes as `<audio controls>` players in the feed.
- `Wall.vue`: change the computed `title`.

**Dependencies & Risks**
- `MediaRecorder`/`getUserMedia` need a secure context + mic permission; guard and notify on failure.
- The composer runs inside an iframe (`allow="microphone *"`) so the mic is available.
- `FileReader.readAsDataURL` in `ChatAttachment.fromFile` already base64-encodes any MIME type, so audio needs no new encoding path.

**Target Files**
| File | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| `src/components/wall/wallEvents.js` | `unreadOnly` filter + audio attachment mapping |
| `src/api/model/ChatAttachment.js` | `isAudio()` |
| `src/components/wall/WallComposer.vue` | audio recording + accept broadening |
| `src/components/chat/ChatAttachmentPreview.vue` | audio preview/playback |
| `src/components/wall/WallAttachment.vue` | audio player in feed |
| `src/components/wall/Wall.vue` | "Welcome <name>" title |

## 2. File changes, Code Block Formatting & Proposed Changes

